{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15114710","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15114710","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1511471001:0":{"text":"那非！好孩子，我就知道你一定能赢得猎血节。","source_cn":"那非！好孩子，我就知道你一定能赢得猎血节。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF940F66327EEF674","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1511471002:0":{"text":"顿……他战死了，是吗？","source_cn":"顿……他战死了，是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E7A04AAD057570A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511471003:0":{"text":"……对不起。","source_cn":"……对不起。<key:dialog478>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F6EB2CC5CCEC25D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511471004:0":{"text":"不是你的错……猎血节原本就很残酷。","source_cn":"不是你的错……猎血节原本就很残酷。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x594743FD674E7DA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1511471005:0":{"text":"还记得上一次猎血节，所有参加的战士都战死了，连最后的胜者都没有。","source_cn":"还记得上一次猎血节，所有参加的战士都战死了，连最后的胜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3870BABC081C18C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1511471006:0":{"text":"你能活着回来，成为雅库伯尔的勇士，雅库伯尔人人都很高兴。包括我，也包括顿。","source_cn":"你能活着回来，成为雅库伯尔的勇士，雅库伯尔人人都很高兴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52DE32FA6565D5C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1511471007:0":{"text":"……但我不高兴。","source_cn":"……但我不高兴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9A43C57286EA8B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1511471008:0":{"text":"顿，<style=\"highlight\">他是被狩猎神杀死的</style>。","source_cn":"顿，<style=highlight>他是被狩猎神杀死...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD4773E349E76378","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1511471009:0":{"text":"你、你说什么？","source_cn":"你、你说什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9870AF90E39E7C95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511471010:0":{"text":"顿和我一起坚持到了最后。狩猎神降临在我们面前，让我们挑战她。","source_cn":"顿和我一起坚持到了最后。狩猎神降临在我们面前，让我们挑战她。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A6AF27D8093A2E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1511471011:0":{"text":"顿照做了……然后就被狩猎神杀死了。","source_cn":"顿照做了……然后就被狩猎神杀死了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E600EAA626B592F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1511471012:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1511471013:0":{"text":"他死在了雅库伯尔之月赐予的荣耀之下。","source_cn":"他死在了雅库伯尔之月赐予的荣耀之下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77A8613F953247D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1511471014:0":{"text":"荣耀……？你觉得这是荣耀？！","source_cn":"荣耀……？你觉得这是荣耀？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4AD86C981BB04F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1511471015:0":{"text":"我们是兽群之主的信徒，是她的仆从。死在她手中，当然是一种荣耀……","source_cn":"我们是兽群之主的信徒，是她的仆从。死在她手中，当然是一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x346A918B83E9F8D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1511471016:0":{"text":"可她完全不在乎信徒的生命！顿是这样，其他人也是！","source_cn":"可她完全不在乎信徒的生命！顿是这样，其他人也是！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD92F0B0C0E84B358","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1511471017:0":{"text":"但这是神的意志。","source_cn":"但这是神的意志。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDB3870EEC2AAF43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1511471018:0":{"text":"无论神恩赐什么，都<style=\"highlight\">只能是荣耀</style>。你明白吗？","source_cn":"无论神恩赐什么，都<style=highlight>只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D7E66DB61CB123F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1511471019:0":{"text":"……包括死亡，是吗？","source_cn":"……包括死亡，是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACC813C64B466A51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1511471020:0":{"text":"至少你得到了兽群之主赐予你的神力，雅库伯尔赢得了她的眷顾。","source_cn":"至少你得到了兽群之主赐予你的神力，雅库伯尔赢得了她的眷顾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5343237972F3CEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1511471021:0":{"text":"以同胞之死换取而来的神赐，我不要。","source_cn":"以同胞之死换取而来的神赐，我不要。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C98FE47FAC45710","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1511471022:0":{"text":"你还是那么倔强……","source_cn":"你还是那么倔强……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x